# Hand Gesture Controlled Game

An AI-powered interactive game that uses real-time hand gesture recognition to control gameplay without a keyboard, mouse, or traditional controller.

## About the Project

This project uses a webcam and computer vision to detect hand gestures and translate them into actions inside the game. The player can interact with enemies and control different abilities using natural hand movements.

The goal is to create a more interactive and immersive gaming experience by turning the user's hand into a virtual game controller.

## Features

* Real-time hand gesture detection
* Webcam-based computer vision
* Gesture-based game controls
* Gun gesture for shooting
* Thumb movement to simulate pulling the trigger
* Open-palm gesture for activating the shield
* Fist gesture for entering combat mode
* Enemy interaction and hit detection
* Score and gameplay tracking
* Controller-free gameplay

## How It Works

The webcam captures the user's hand movements. The hand tracking system identifies the position and shape of the hand and recognizes predefined gestures.

These gestures are then mapped to specific actions in the game.

| Hand Gesture   | Game Action       |
| -------------- | ----------------- |
| Gun Gesture    | Aim and shoot     |
| Thumb movement | Pull the trigger  |
| Open Palm      | Activate shield   |
| Fist           | Enter combat mode |

