## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Mr-shroff/hand-gesture-project.git
```

Go into the project directory:

```bash
cd hand-gesture-project
```

Install the required Python libraries:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Running the Project

Run the main Python file:

```bash
python main.py
```

If your project uses a different Python file as the entry point, replace `main.py` with the appropriate filename.

Allow the application to access your webcam and show the required hand gestures in front of the camera.

